nvidia-legacy-96xx-driver is a metapackage. It pulls in the runtime
libraries, the Xorg driver, the utilities, the kernel-support glue and (for the
DKMS flavour) the DKMS module source for NVIDIA 96.43.23.

Hardware: GeForce 2/3/4 Ti series (NV1x, NV2x)
Upstream status: Upstream EOL 2012. Forward-port target kernel 6.12 LTS / xserver ABI 12. High risk.

To remove every trace:  apt purge '~nnvidia-legacy-96xx-.*'
